{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20207","headline":"吊元鲁山 六 · 孟郊","name":"吊元鲁山 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"言从鲁山宦，尽化尧时心。\n豺狼耻狂噬，齿牙闭霜金。\n竞来辟田土，相与畊嶔岑。\n当宵无关锁，竟岁饶歌吟。\n善教复天术，美词非俗箴。\n精微自然事，视听不可寻。\n因书鲁山绩，庶合箫韶音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20207.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20207","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}